        {
          "id": 1284084701,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Late reply. Wireshark for Windows ARM package is available in msys2, here https://packages.msys2.org/package/mingw-w64-clang-aarch64-wireshark?repo=clangarm64. I have tested it using Raspberry Pi 4B and an Android phone with USB tethering. npcap kernel mode driver seems to be working.\n\nHope there will be official Windows ARM installer soon.",
